<title>MEXICO: RESEARCH ALERT - GCorvi  downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - GCorvi  downgraded.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finamex brokerage downgraded Mexican distributors and retailers Grupo Corvi (GCorvi) to hold from buy on Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;In light of the bad fourth quarter report and considering that it was the second time in a row that the company's results were much below our own and the market's expectations, we have decided to downgrade Corvi from buy to hold,&quot; analyst Francisco Rivero said in a report.</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom (525) 7289530. E-mail at chris.aspin@reuters.com))</p>
</text>
